# Keep the build context small and keep two things out of the image in
# particular: credentials, and the source PDF.
#
# data/ holds thesis.pdf and the canonical extraction. Neither is needed at
# run time — the committed index/ is what the assistant queries — and leaving
# the document out of a distributable image avoids redistributing a work that
# is only licensed for reading.

.git
.gitignore
.github

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

data/
docs/

.DS_Store
*.swp
